sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SRC as Order Source (POS, QR, App)
    participant API as API Server
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant KS as Kitchen Service
    participant SS as Socket Server
    participant EXP as Expeditor (KDS Main)
    participant ST as Station KDS (Grill/Fry/Salad)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    SRC->>API: Submit Order
    API->>OS: Validate & Save Order
    OS->>DB: Insert Order (Status: PLACED)
    OS->>KS: Process for Kitchen

    KS->>KS: Generate KOT (Order #, Table #, Type, Priority, Modifiers)
    KS->>DB: Save KOT
    
    loop For each item in KOT
        KS->>KS: Determine Station based on Category Mapping
    end

    par Route to Stations
        KS->>SS: Emit 'new-kot-item' to Station Rooms
        SS->>ST: Display items (FIFO, Color-coded urgency)
    and Route to Expeditor
        KS->>SS: Emit 'new-kot' to Expeditor Room
        SS->>EXP: Display full order summary
    end

    note over ST: Kitchen Staff starts preparation
    ST->>SS: Tap item -> Start
    SS->>KS: Update item status: IN_PROGRESS
    KS->>DB: Save item status (Start Timer)
    KS->>SS: Emit 'item-status-update'
    SS->>EXP: Show item in progress

    alt Item 86'd (Out of Stock)
        ST->>SS: Flag Item -> 86'd
        SS->>KS: Update stock & notify
        KS->>SS: Emit 'item-cancelled' (Notify Waiter/POS)
    else Prep Delayed
        ST->>SS: Flag Item -> Delayed (Timer turns Yellow/Red >80% estimated time)
    end

    note over ST: Item Prep Finished
    ST->>SS: Tap item -> READY
    SS->>KS: Update item status: READY
    KS->>DB: Save item status (Stop Timer)
    KS->>SS: Emit 'item-ready'
    SS->>EXP: Mark item ready in order view

    opt All Items Ready
        KS->>KS: Check if all items in order are READY
        KS->>OS: Update Order Status -> READY_TO_SERVE
        OS->>SS: Emit 'order-ready-to-serve'
        SS->>EXP: Highlight order as complete
    end

    note over EXP: Expeditor Verification
    EXP->>SS: Bump Order (Send to Service)
    SS->>KS: Update Order Status -> BUMPED
    KS->>DB: Log completion time for metrics
    KS->>SS: Emit 'serve-order' (Notify Waiter/Runner)

    opt Recall & Refire
        EXP->>SS: Recall Item (Returned/Mod mid-prep)
        SS->>KS: Generate Refire Ticket / Updated Ticket
        KS->>SS: Emit 'refire-item' to ST
    end

    par Background Metrics (Real-time)
        KS->>DB: Calculate Avg Prep Time (Item/Category)
        KS->>DB: Update Station Throughput
        KS->>DB: Log SLA Breaches
        KS->>DB: Log Items 86'd today
    end
